# Build context of docker/Dockerfile.server and docker/Dockerfile.tts: only
# what their release builds need (allow-list). Everything else (target/,
# node_modules/, .git/, data, docs, tests' artefacts) stays out of the context.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!LICENSE
!THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt
!crates/
!web/index.html
!web/css/
!web/js/
!web/img/
# Dockerfile.tts: the TTS image's licence files.
!docker/tts-licenses/
